text = "Level Designer, you can delete this later.

The smallest public house. Barely has room for a dozen but that doesn’t stop drinkers cramming in.

This is an interior space and you can use the copper_kettle_interior.tscn level as a guide, but the Oyle in Wall should be much smaller."
wrap_mode = 1
